title: Only the changed files on the canvas: with the diff on, while a commit is shown and after everything is committed (nothing changed: the canvas says so or is empty, and all files come back with 'changed off')
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/.git/logs/HEAD :: commit: everything
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
changed on
wait 1500
mark 1-only-changed
wait 500
diff on
wait 1500
mark 2-only-changed-diff
wait 500
commit 0
wait 1800
mark 3-only-changed-commit
wait 500
commit off
wait 1500
diff off
wait 1000
git stage
wait 1200
mark 4-all-staged
wait 500
git commit everything
wait 2000
mark 5-nothing-changed
wait 500
changed off
wait 1500
mark 6-all-files
wait 500
quit
